acy of 0.61. The confusion matrix on the right visualizes the classification results, with true labels on the vertical axis and predicted labels on the horizontal axis, highlighting the distribution of correct and incorrect predictions across the risk c\ategories.␀)/K 5/P 22015 0 R/Pg 453 0 R/S/Figure/Type/StructElem>>endobj22065 0 obj<</K 22134 0 R/P 22015 0 R/S/Caption/Type/StructElem>>endobj22066 0 obj<</A 22133 0 R/Alt(The image consists of two parts: a classification report and a confusion matrix for a tuned K-Nearest Neighbors \(KNN\) model. The classification report shows precision, recall, f1-score, and support for three categories: High Risk, Moderate Risk, and No \Risk. The best cross-validated accuracy is approximately 0.959. The confusion matrix visualizes the model's performance, with true labels on the y-axis and predicted labels on the x-axis, highlighting the number of correct and incorrect predictions for ea\ch risk category.␀)/K 8/P 22015 0 R/Pg 453 0 R/S/Figure/Type/StructElem>>endobj22067 0 obj<</K 22132 0 R/P 22015 0 R/S/Caption/Type/StructElem>>endobj22068 0 obj<</A 10715 0 R/K[22104 0 R 22105 0 R 22106 0 R]/P 22015 0 R/S/Table/Type/StructElem>>endobj22069 0 obj<</K[46<</MCID 1/Pg 459 0 R/Type/MCR>>]/P 22015 0 R/Pg 450 0 R/S/P/Type/StructElem>>endobj22070 0 obj<</K[22086 0 R 22087 0 R 22088 0 R 22089 0 R 22090 0 R 22091 0 R]/P 22015 0 R/Pg 450 0 R/S/L/Type/StructElem>>endobj22071 0 obj<</K 16/P 22015 0 R/Pg 459 0 R/S/P/Type/StructElem>>endobj22072 0 obj<</K[22077 0 R 22078 0 R 22079 0 R]/P 22015 0 R/Pg 459 0 R/S/L/Type/StructElem>>endobj22073 0 obj<</K 31/P 22015 0 R/Pg 459 0 R/S/P/Type/StructElem>>endobj22074 0 obj<</K 33/P 22015 0 R/Pg 459 0 R/S/H2/Type/StructElem>>endobj22075 0 obj<</K[35<</MCID 1/Pg 462 0 R/Type/MCR>>]/P 22015 0 R/Pg 459 0 R/S/P/Type/StructElem>>endobj22076 0 obj<</K 3/P 22015 0 R/Pg 462 0 R/S/H2/Type/StructElem>>endobj22077 0 obj<</K[22084 0 R 22085 0 R]/P 22072 0 R/S/LI/Type/Struc